ance granted to `spender` by the caller. This is an alternative to {approve} that can be used as a mitigation for problems described in {IERC20-approve}. Emits an {Approval} event indicating the updated allowance. Requirements: - `spender` cannot be the zero address. - `spender` must have allowance for the caller of at least `subtractedValue`."},"deposit(address,uint256)":{"details":"Deposit cvxCRV token to this contract","params":{"_amount":"- The amount of cvxCRV to deposit.","_recipient":"- The address who will receive the aCRV token."},"returns":{"share":"- The amount of aCRV received."}},"depositAll(address)":{"details":"Deposit all cvxCRV token of the sender to this contract","params":{"_recipient":"The address who will receive the aCRV token."},"returns":{"share":"- The amount of aCRV received."}},"depositAllWithCRV(address)":{"details":"Deposit all CRV token of the sender to this contract","params":{"_recipient":"The address who will receive the aCRV token."},"returns":{"share":"- The amount of aCRV received."}},"depositWithCRV(address,uint256)":{"details":"Deposit CRV token to this contract","params":{"_amount":"- The amount of CRV to deposit.","_recipient":"- The address who will receive the aCRV token."},"returns":{"share":"- The amount of aCRV received."}},"harvest(address,uint256)":{"details":"Harvest the pending reward and convert to cvxCRV.","params":{"_minimumOut":"- The minimum amount of cvxCRV should get.","_recipient":"- The address of account to receive harvest bounty."}},"increaseAllowance(address,uint256)":{"details":"Atomically increases the allowance granted to `spender` by the caller. This is an alternative to {approve} that can be used as a mitigation for problems described in {IERC20-approve}. Emits an {Approval} event indicating the updated allowance. Requirements: - `spender` cannot be the zero address."},"name()":{"details":"Returns the name of the token."},"owner()":{"details":"Returns the address of the current owner."},"pending3CRVRewards()":{"details":"Return the amount of pending 3CRV rewards"},"pendingCRVRewards()":{"details":"Return the amount of pending CRV rewards"},"pendingCVXRewards()":{"details":"Return the amount of pending CVX rewards"},"renounceOwnership()":{"details":"Leaves the contract without owner. It will not be possible to call `onlyOwner` functions anymore. Can only be called by the current owner. NOTE: Renouncing ownership will leave the contract without an owner, thereby removing any functionality that is only available to the owner."},"symbol()":{"details":"Returns the symbol of the token, usually a shorter version of the name."},"totalSupply()":{"details":"See {IERC20-totalSupply}."},"totalUnderlying()":{"details":"Return the total amount of cvxCRV staked."},"transfer(address,uint256)":{"details":"See {IERC20-transfer}. Requirements: - `recipient` cannot be the zero address. - the caller must have a balance of at least `amount`."},"transferFrom(address,address,uint256)":{"details":"See {IERC20-transferFrom}. Emits an {Approval} event indicating the updated allowance. This is not required by the EIP. See the note at the beginning of {ERC20}. Requirements: - `sender` and `recipient` cannot be the zero address. - `sender` must have a balance of at least `amount`. - the caller must have allowance for ``sender``'s tokens of at least `amount`."},"transferOwnership(address)":{"details":"Transfers ownership of the contract to a new account (`newOwner`). Can only be called by the current owner."},"updateHarvestBountyPercentage(uint256)":{"details":"Update the harvest bounty percentage.","params":{"_percentage":"- The fee percentage to update."}},"updatePlatform(address)":{"details":"Update the recipient"},"updatePlatformFeePercentage(uint256)":{"details":"Update the platform fee percentage.","params":{"_feePercentage":"- The fee percentage to update."}},"updateWithdrawFeePercentage(uint256)":{"details":"Update the withdraw fee percentage.","params":{"_feePercentage":"- The fee percentage to update."}},"updateZap(address)":{"details":"Update the zap contract"},"withdraw(address,uint256,uint256,uint8)":{"details":"Withdraw cvxCRV in proportion to the amount of shares sent","params":{"_minimumOut":"- The minimum amount of token should be received.","_option":"- The withdraw option (as cvxCRV or CRV or CVX or ETH or stake to convex).","_recipient":"- The address who will receive the withdrawn token.","_shares":"- The amount of aCRV to send."},"returns":{"withdrawn":"- The amount of token returned to the user."}},"withdrawAll(address,uint256,uint8)":{"details":"Withdraw all cvxCRV in proportion to the amount of shares sent","params":{"_minimumOut":"- The minimum amount of token should be received.","_option":"- The withdraw option (as cvxCRV or CRV or CVX or ETH or stake to convex).","_recipient":"- The address who will receive the withdrawn token."},"returns":{"_0":"withdrawn - The amount of token returned to the user."}}},"stateVariables":{"harvestBountyPercentage":{"details":"The percentage of rewards to take for caller on harvest"},"platform":{"details":"The address of recipient of platform fee"},"platformFeePercentage":{"details":"The percentage of rewards to take for platform on harvest"},"withdrawFeePercentage":{"details":"The percentage of token to take on withdraw"},"zap":{"details":"The address of ZAP contract, will be used to swap tokens."}},"version":1},"userdoc":{"kind":"user","methods":{},"version":1}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"contracts/vaults/AladdinCRV.sol":"AladdinCRV"},"evmVersion":"istanbul","libraries":{},"metadata":{"bytecodeHash":"ipfs"},"optimizer":{"enabled":true,"runs":200},"remappings":[]},"sources":{"@openzeppelin/contracts-upgradeable/access/OwnableUpgradeable.sol":{"keccak256":"0xba7ba5b188c0b27489bad1efee8d8b1dcebb502785192b22e3d69824a802983d","license":"MIT","urls":["bzz-raw://9f75966b1b75eee4372f7bb11527ca364811d13383bac8cb80f053fb363385d8","dweb:/ipfs/QmWtP47c3NQ34fvujoBu1nqwYMCspWJpJfKUQv5gJKQcZy"]},"@o